  "limitations": [
    "Candidate: public build 4d4c642 (rc5), a sanitized export of SpaceApp release/1.1.7-rc5 c067c535c2: rc3 7619ef9523 plus dependency security updates only (hono 4.13.11, sanitize-html 2.18.1 with launder 1.7.2, dayjs 1.11.23, postcss 8.5.31, nanoid 3.3.20, is-plain-object 5.1.0, deepmerge removed; vite 7.3.7 and vitest/@vitest/* 4.1.12 in the build and test tools). The rc3 release run 39715361335 stopped at its own security gates before publishing anything.",
    "Tested artifacts: launcher run-spaceapp-1.1.7.tgz sha256 b3dec1aa3630d6a2273e8300ab7cf5347d2e45d05daf5f5db8e48955614fd9fb (byte-identical to rc3's); images by ID from the archive images-1.1.7.tar.gz sha256 9051fc6214edf2d463f5e37b18fe0711db1bfe36d6e32595a25848b487bac575: core sha256:d1065b29ed6e52a9288bbeb5d2f19d5ac39c8930aca8545e80fb78728167054b, cli sha256:94c2fc87287442a944cf3a3b0d7123ef43143015d15a05f375150d428c360349, browser sha256:19a23a7e4a2de526da8887209af57c27a9c30de4f08e6e93e00dc697561c628e; the lab runners identify them by the IDs containerd reported for images loaded from that sha256-verified archive. The release workflow rebuilds the images from this source (IR117-C-F7).",
    "Carried proofs (Nous 2026-10-22, option C and B' for Windows first agent): windows first-agent (reason: rc4/rc5 change only hono, sanitize-html, vite, vitest; OpenCode 2.0.32, wrapper and prompts identical to rc3; rc5 Windows runs failed on Zen transport errors and a free-model stop); windows starter-getting-started (supplementary) (reason: rc4/rc5 change only hono, sanitize-html, vite, vitest; OpenCode 2.0.32, wrapper and prompts identical to rc3; rc5 Windows runs failed on Zen transport errors and a free-model stop); windows profiles small/medium/large (reason: rc5 = rc3 + dependency patches only (hono 4.13.11, sanitize-html 2.18.1, vite 7.3.7, vitest 4.1.12); launcher tgz byte-identical (b3dec1aa); images differ only in hono, sanitize-html, postcss and their dependencies); macos profiles small/medium/large (reason: rc5 = rc3 + dependency patches only (hono 4.13.11, sanitize-html 2.18.1, vite 7.3.7, vitest 4.1.12); launcher tgz byte-identical (b3dec1aa); images differ only in hono, sanitize-html, postcss and their dependencies). Each is rc3 060d85a's executed proof, not rerun on rc5, marked carriedFrom \"rc3 060d85a\" with its rc3 artifact copied unchanged as rc3-<name>; the rc5 Windows failure evidence is attached as rc5-failure-*. The release check does not show carriedFrom; this list and README.md do.",
    "Executed on rc5: fresh install, the 1.1.6 -> 1.1.7 update, repair, install with Docker stopped and the first agent turn on Linux vm218, Windows vm219 (signed-in desktop) and macOS vm221, plus the profiles listed under rc5Profiles in each profiles check.",
    "VM hosts are x86_64. ARM64 container validation remains a release workflow gate.",
    "Fresh installer timings use preloaded local candidate images; they exclude network image downloads.",
